      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Lateral hip pain, or greater trochanteric pain syndrome, is a commonly seen condition; in this article, the relevant anatomy, epidemiology, and evaluation strategies of greater trochanteric pain syndrome are reviewed. Specific attention is focused on imaging of this syndrome and treatment techniques, including ultrasound-guided interventions."
      },
